# 🚀 Mindease Investor-Ready Overhaul — Walkthrough

## Summary

Implemented **17 new features and fixes** across **30+ files**, transforming Mindease from a hackathon project into an investor-ready product. Build verified **2 times with zero errors**.

---

## 🔴 Critical Fixes Completed

### 1. Logo Path Fix
Fixed logo imports in [Sidebar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/components/Sidebar.jsx) and [LandingPage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/pages/LandingPage.jsx) to use ES module imports (`import logo from '../assets/logo.png'`) instead of broken `/src/assets/` paths that fail in production builds.

### 2. Real Streak Calculation
Fixed [Dashboard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/pages/Dashboard.jsx) streak logic — now calculates actual consecutive days by walking backwards from today instead of returning `moodLogs.length`.

### 3. SEO & HTML
Updated [index.html](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/index.html) with proper title, meta description, keywords, Inter font, PWA manifest link, and Apple touch icon.

