## 🟡 High Impact Features

### 4. User Onboarding & Personalization
- [OnboardingModal.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/components/OnboardingModal.jsx) — 3-step animated flow: Name → Goals → Daily Time
