- [ThemeContext.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/context/ThemeContext.jsx) — `data-theme="dark"` toggle
- [global.css](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/styles/global.css) — Full dark mode variable overrides (bg, text, cards, shadows, gradients)
- Toggle button in sidebar footer

### 6. AI Mood Companion (Chatbot)
- [Chatbot.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/pages/Chatbot.jsx) — 100% offline chatbot with:
  - Emotion detection via keyword matching (stressed, anxious, sad, lonely, happy)
  - CBT-based response library
  - Typing indicator animation
  - Quick prompt buttons
  - Privacy badge ("100% Offline · Zero Data Collected")

### 7. Personal Analytics Dashboard
- [Analytics.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/pages/Analytics.jsx) — Features:
  - Wellness Score (0-100 with SVG circle)
  - 30-day Mood Heatmap (GitHub-contribution style)
  - Mood Distribution Pie Chart
  - Best Days of the Week bar chart
  - Achievement badge grid (12 badges)
  - JSON/CSV data export buttons

### 8. Gamification System
- [achievements.js](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/utils/achievements.js) — 12 achievements:
  🌱 First Step · 🔥 Building Momentum · 💪 One Week Strong · 🏆 Monthly Warrior · ✍️ Reflective Mind · 📖 Journaling Warrior · 🧘 Zen Master · 🦉 Night Owl · 🌅 Early Bird · ☮️ Inner Peace · 🎵 Soul Healer · 📊 Data Explorer

### 9. Smart Reminders
Dashboard shows a yellow reminder banner when user hasn't checked in today: "You haven't checked in today — how are you feeling?"

