## 🟢 Differentiators

### 10. SOS Panic Button
- [SOSButton.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/components/SOSButton.jsx) — Floating red button (bottom-right) with pulsing animation. Opens emergency panel with:
  - "Breathe Now" → breathing session
  - "Calming Sounds" → music station
  - "Emergency Helplines" → resources page

### 11. Mood-Responsive Theming
- [global.css](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/styles/global.css) — 4 mood color palettes via `data-mood` attribute:
  - Calm → Green (#3EBD93)
  - Focused → Indigo (#6366F1)  
  - Stressed → Amber (#F59E0B)
  - Overwhelmed → Pink (#EC4899)

### 12. Sleep Tracker
- [SleepTracker.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/pages/SleepTracker.jsx) — Bedtime/wake time logging, 5-star quality rating, weekly bar chart, sleep tips, average stats

### 13. Guided Meditation Library
- [MeditationSession.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/components/sessions/MeditationSession.jsx) — 3 guided sessions:
  - Body Scan (5 min) · Gratitude (3 min) · Mindful Moment (2 min)
  - Animated breathing circle, step-by-step text prompts, progress bar

### 14. Daily Wellness Plans
- [wellnessPlan.js](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/utils/wellnessPlan.js) — Generates personalized morning/afternoon/evening plans based on mood

### 15. Data Export
- [exportData.js](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/src/utils/exportData.js) — JSON backup + CSV export of all user data

### 16. PWA Support
- [manifest.json](file:///c:/Users/Atharv/OneDrive/Desktop/Mindease/New%20folder/public/manifest.json) — Installable as native-like app on phones

